# On death (keepInventory): delete items with Curse of Vanishing.
# List-form enchantments predicate (map-style fails to parse in 1.21.11).

execute if items entity @s container.0 *[minecraft:enchantments~[{enchantments:"minecraft:vanishing_curse"}]] run item replace entity @s container.0 with minecraft:air
